{title: Find Me}
{artist: Bethel Music}
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
[D] [Bm] [G] [D]

{comment: Verse 1}
[D]I fall down upon the ground
Press my [Bm]face against the earth
Till my h[G]eart it rises over my he[D]ad
As the wh[D]eat it bows down low
When the a[Bm]utumn wind blows
I k[G]neel before the One I lo[D]ve

{comment: Chorus}
[D]Find me grateful
[Bm]Find me thankful
[G]Find me on my k[D]nees
[D]Find me dreaming
[Bm]Find me singing
[G]Find me lost in Your g[D]race

{comment: Verse 2}
Like the d[D]ust that You first held
In a [Bm]garden where You knelt
[G]Pull me up against Your face a[D]gain
Till the b[D]reath of Your hope
Fill the [Bm]depths of my soul
Till a[G]ll I know is I've been found by l[D]ove
